# head/adult/man/nose_straight: the man's straight nose: a 2 px shadow down the bridge; 2 rows proud in profile
# The slice (P2b wave 1, FOLK-BODY; to FACES in wave 2). Every head type keeps A3's eye rows and columns, the nose pixel
# and the mouth row (STYLE_P2 4), so expressions, marks and paint fit them all. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body man
role nose straight
layer face
anchor head
keys rest

view D key rest origin -8 -10
|r
|r

view U key rest origin 0 0
|.

view R key rest origin -14 -10
|sq
|rq

view L key rest origin 0 -10
|qt
|qs

# (P2b FACES) elven fineness: thinner, swept-up brows and a finer nose for elves (when elf replace)
view D key rest origin -7 -10 when elf replace
|t.
|.r

view R key rest origin -14 -10 when elf replace
|sq

view L key rest origin 0 -10 when elf replace
|qt
